        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Meina mpouc himdaimei pu",
            "Houmu nu rui Kalvary khou",
            "Apum bumaeng ta kallou khang",
            "Houmuh mei baan khou kapum tilou,",
            "Mei khaeng ngam makmei rianra khaeng",
            "bam khou Kandi zing baangla zaibam.",
            "",
            "Kagan naguang the",
            "Abumang ringmei lakhang tei",
            "Nthiammei khaeng ngam makmei guai",
            "Latzan tingmik guangtang pui kaan khou",
            "Tingkao thang baanhaamna huai bam sini",
            "Lalou dat nituang hamh the.",
            "",
            "2. Kabaan hamthauna kapu khou",
            "Guangtang mak khang huainei bam e",
            "Apu rui nutuang khuan e thei",
            "Zang nimei kamkuak laganlou o",
            "Ai ningmei hamhna apu rui ningmei",
            "Pat kandiu aru khou hei.",
            "",
            "3. Kamei theikei nipui ding khou",
            "“Eloi, eloi lama sabak thani”",
            "Tuna khuan ranna kau",
            "Kabumaeng patkan nipui ding khou",
            "Bu le nei gaanchuanga guai nchungna",
            "Kariu tipat ngam makge."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
